---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="The app · Mental Note" active="the-app">
<div class="phead"><div class="wrap">
  <h1>The app</h1>
</div></div>
<div class="light"><div class="block" style="padding-top:64px"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="appcols">
    <div class="appcopy">
      <p>The Mental Note app is a quick check-in you can do each morning. It asks you a few questions to start your day, and there's space to vent if you need it. The questions change with the weekly theme.</p>
      <p>Your answers are saved on your phone and nowhere else. We can't see them, and you don't need to make an account.</p>
      <p>One thing to know: if you clear your browser data, your answers get deleted too. If you want to keep them, use the export button to save a copy.</p>
      <p class="need">Need to talk to someone now? Call or text <b>988</b>, or text <b>HOME</b> to <b>741741</b>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stick s1 tape getit">
      <strong>Put it on your phone</strong>
      <p><b>iPhone:</b> open this page in Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen.</p>
      <p><b>Android:</b> your browser should ask if you want to install it.</p>
      <a class="go" href="#">Open the check-in</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
